# Description of all scripts

## job_array.sh

This script is an example of how to submit simulations to Leftraru using job arrays. This approach allows for the submission of simultaneous simulations, letting the Leftraru scheduler decide when to execute each one based on the script's parameters. Specifically, this script submits 81 simulations in batches of 10 at a time. It is also important to note that individual job scripts for each material are not necessary; all the logic is centralized in job_array.sh.
